      "chunks": [
        {
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "chunk_id": "s05_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c1_geomformer_keeps_two_representations",
          "text": "GeoMFormer keeps two representations for every atom: an invariant feature vector and an equivariant three-dimensional feature. These flow through two parallel Transformer streams. Within each stream, a self-attention module first mixes information across atoms.",
