        {
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "chunk_id": "s05_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c3_key_innovation_cross_attention_modul",
          "text": "Then, the key innovation, a cross-attention module lets each stream query the other: the invariant stream attends to the equivariant stream and vice versa, fusing the two kinds of geometric information.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "key",
            "innovation",
