          "chunk_id": "s05_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c4_feed_forward_network_completes_block",
          "text": "A feed-forward network completes each block, and blocks are stacked. Because the design uses only standard Transformer components arranged this way, many earlier geometric networks fall out as special cases of the framework.",
